  "important_constraints": [
    "Do not infer unavailable context, beta, RAM, or numerical action values from candidate names.",
    "Do not treat rollout-level K6 rows as state-level selector samples.",
    "Do not create positive deployment labels from near-miss samples.",
    "Keep empirical/default as the active runtime during initial Phase-L.",
    "Invalid or failed routing studies must remain distinguishable through provenance and status."
  ]
